      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "reYanD-OHY3pOrMllDT5y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4771.585517887031,
      "y": 1174.4699320162156,
      "width": 1234.5692115719157,
      "height": 1379.5406552209458,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1333963416,
      "version": 2462,
      "versionNonce": 55262354,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779828073044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Steps for migration\n1. [x] Update the database:\n    - New attributes\n    - New tables\n    - Add relationships\n2. [x] Update the Schemas and SQLAlchemy Models in the server\n3. [x] Update scores of update to modify components as well,\nadd the difficulty computation and status updates in the\nevaluators pipelines\n4. [x] Update the client and server to have default languages\nwhen creating and that iso639 codes be stored inside user\npreferences and languages, and update generator and evaluator\nmodels\n5. [x] Update the client and server to make it possible to add,\nmodify and delete sources and tags to elements\n6. [x] Create a login page where user can select which profile\nthey want, adapt the rest of the application to use the user_id\n7. [x] Create a page profile settings to set and update user\npreferences\n8. [x] Use the tokenizer to extract Words from Passages and\nCharacters from Words, link them if they already exists, if not\ncreate new ones, give them AI source and then link them\n9. [x] Create a nav bar with a search bar to navigate elements of\na user\n10. [x] Implement the Data Collection of Progress Tracking at\nevery score update\n11. [x] Implement the Daily Stats and Commitment Log and display\nit for each user.\n12. [ ] Update the new updated create process for features",
      "fontSize": 38.05629393712954,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Steps for migration\n1. [x] Update the database:\n    - New attributes\n    - New tables\n    - Add relationships\n2. [x] Update the Schemas and SQLAlchemy Models in the server\n3. [x] Update scores of update to modify components as well, add the difficulty computation and status updates in the evaluators pipelines\n4. [x] Update the client and server to have default languages when creating and that iso639 codes be stored inside user preferences and languages, and update generator and evaluator models\n5. [x] Update the client and server to make it possible to add, modify and delete sources and tags to elements\n6. [x] Create a login page where user can select which profile they want, adapt the rest of the application to use the user_id\n7. [x] Create a page profile settings to set and update user preferences\n8. [x] Use the tokenizer to extract Words from Passages and Characters from Words, link them if they already exists, if not create new ones, give them AI source and then link them\n9. [x] Create a nav bar with a search bar to navigate elements of a user\n10. [x] Implement the Data Collection of Progress Tracking at every score update\n11. [x] Implement the Daily Stats and Commitment Log and display it for each user.\n12. [ ] Update the new updated create process for features",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NNyPFOD4wADVE-I1QzSQb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3465.467097192752,
      "y": 2007.6832337040053,
      "width": 133.80941806890806,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFC",
